7	// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
8	// Fixtures — fully implemented (not under test): a minimal PendingState and a
9	// hand-built HTML fixture string matching the markup contract rendered by
10	// src/view/components/matrix.rs (see that file's `render_matrix`). Exact
11	// whitespace/attribute order doesn't matter — only the elements/classes/data
12	// attributes matrix-interactions.ts's mount() must bind to.
13	// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
